Z||000000||JayUSA77||07-21-2001||04:00 PM||||Hey guys a while back i was going to get a HOOKER roll bar made for the fiero on ebay. Unfortunatly the a$$hole outbid me while i was off the internet and i lost. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> oh well right.  But do you guys know who still makes a rollbar that is made for the fiero.. I dont really wanna try to fit any kind of rollbar in my car if its not designed for it.<BR>thanks for all your help.<BR>j<P>------------------<BR>86' Black Fiero GT||||reg||1
Z||000001||Mach10||07-21-2001||04:33 PM||||Pontiac does. Have you ever seen the size of the pillar?!?<P>I assume that you need one for competition purposes. You need to find one that's per-spec. I'd check with your association.||||reg||7
Z||000002||Standard||07-21-2001||08:13 PM||||Kirk Racing<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/roll_bar.jpg">  <P>This is their non-scca legal bar.  The SCCA legal one has a diagnol brace that goes through the space the console and ECM occupy.  <P>They have a webpage that's under construction and <A HREF="http://www.kirkracing.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kirkracing.com</A>   <BR>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">         <BR>1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed<P><FONT SIZE="1">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto<BR><FONT COLOR="red">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Standard (edited 07-21-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||rogergarrison||07-21-2001||08:44 PM||||so whos seen the side/roll bars that go from the dash area past the seat bolster to the rear pillars? I wonder if theyd add enough rigidity to support a full targa or convertible conversion. still be ez enough to get in and out thru open door? <P>comments????||||reg||1
Z||000004||Wannabe||07-22-2001||12:08 AM||||I spoke with Kirk racing a few weeks ago. They now have and SCCA legal set up that uses a removable Petty bar that runs to the floor on the passenger's side. Assuming you are using the car for competition, the bar is set up so that you can remove it for normal day to day use.||||reg||1
